<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<catalogue id="4b84-d5a4-baf1-9aff" name="Halo - UNSC" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="6f3b-423b-f7e2-caee" gameSystemRevision="1" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema"><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="5132-b059-19cc-16fd" name="Army Setup" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="97e3-6bdd-a707-2979"/><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="b9fc-26ea-ab98-d47b"/></constraints><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="0083-6b42-d389-db6c" name="Army Setup" hidden="false" targetId="a02c-b714-98ad-b8e8" primary="true"/></categoryLinks><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="525b-0c19-2764-5fab" name="Army" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="afb4-1322-dae6-24e9"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="a4b3-6dbc-2207-56ca"/><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="37be-fb45-b982-1352"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="afb4-1322-dae6-24e9" name="Army: UNSC" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="579d-93ef-8920-45b1"/></constraints><rules><rule id="0ba9-835d-3828-8c74" name="Desperate Measures" hidden="false"><description>When a UNSC Infantry or Artillery unit is reduced to half or less of its initial starting strength (rounding up), the remaining models in that unit gain the Stubborn special rule. Units that already have Stubborn gain Fanatics instead. Units that already have Fanatics gain High Resolve instead.

Reminder:
Stubborn: Ignore pin modifiers on Morale checks, remember Morale checks are not Order tests.

Fanatics: Ignore pin modifiers on Morale checks and are not routed by pins. If defeated in close quarters, fight again immediately until they win or are wiped out.

High Resolve: Whenever this unit successfully passes an Order test by rolling a double, it counts as having rolled Incredible Courage! and immediately removes all of its Pin markers rather than just one.</description></rule><rule id="3c90-c446-fbcd-5fc0" name="Experienced Commanders" hidden="false"><description>When a UNSC Officer uses the ‘You men, snap to action!’ ability, they may draw and assign one additional Order Die from the bag to a friendly unit within range, following the normal rules for that ability. This increases the number of units that can be activated by one.</description></rule><rule id="0d24-3753-534d-8c08" name="Spartan Leadership" hidden="false"><description>Friendly UNSC units may re-roll failed Morale checks if at least one model in the unit has line of sight to a friendly Spartan model that is not Down.</description></rule><rule id="8cac-3f55-43b0-7f22" name="Battle-Net Intrusion" hidden="false"><description>Once per game, at the start of any Game Turn, the UNSC player may choose one Order Die to draw from the dice bag instead of drawing randomly. If this Order Die is assigned to an Officer, it cannot be used to trigger You Men, Snap to Action! If more than one player wishes to use a rule that allows them to choose or draw an Order Die before the first random Order Die draw of the turn, roll off. The winner uses their rule that turn, and the other player must wait until a future turn to use theirs.</description></rule></rules></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="68b0-4cb1-646b-1b36" name="Army: Insurrection" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="f88d-b192-f5db-f3f5"/></constraints><rules><rule id="fd32-5a50-41b2-6b9f" name="Prepared Uprising" hidden="false"><description>Any Insurrectionist Infantry unit that is set up on the table before Turn 1 may start the game already in Ambush. If you decide to do so, place one of your order dice next to that unit as if it had been ordered to Ambush before drawing the first order die of Turn 1.

In addition, during Turn 1 of the game, all Insurrectionist Infantry units count as having the Fieldcraft special rule.

Additionally, you may deploy one Infantry unit from your army list as if it had the Infiltrator special rule. This only affects deployment, the unit does not actually gain the Infiltrator special rule during the battle.</description></rule><rule id="ebf6-7855-3377-55c0" name="Hidden Sentries" hidden="false"><description>Each opposing army that is not an Insurrectionist army may deploy a maximum of one unit using the Infiltrator special deployment rules. Any additional units in that army with the Infiltrator special rule cannot use their Infiltrator special deployment.</description></rule><rule id="12ea-aa30-c600-da67" name="Concealed Firing Positions" hidden="false"><description>Insurrectionist Infantry and Artillery units improve their Cover Save by +1 while they have an Ambush order, as long as they are already in cover.</description></rule><rule id="90ef-679c-801b-629d" name="Ambush Drills" hidden="false"><description>When an Insurrectionist Infantry unit is given an Advance order without using Flight, it may choose to go Down instead of firing. If it does so, resolve the unit’s Advance movement as normal, then replace its Advance order die with a Down order die. The unit may not fire, and its activation is complete.</description></rule><rule id="40d5-c321-56e6-0dcd" name="Local Area Control" hidden="false"><description>When an Insurrectionist Infantry unit attempts to enter the battlefield by Reserves or Outflanking, it gains +1 to its Morale value for the Order test made to come onto the table.</description></rule></rules></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="267b-985e-a938-cc1a" name="Officer - Platoon commander" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit"><profiles><profile id="fc3f-8bc0-7763-315d" name="Officer - Platoon commander" hidden="false" typeId="4f99-c622-96b9-db14" typeName="Unit"><modifiers><modifier type="increment" field="c162-476c-a031-003b" value="1"><repeats><repeat value="1" repeats="1" field="selections" scope="267b-985e-a938-cc1a" childId="4bf0-a090-9783-b978" shared="true" roundUp="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></repeats></modifier><modifier type="decrement" field="c162-476c-a031-003b" value="1"/><modifier type="set" field="f2ee-ef5c-ac2f-0a29" value="3+"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="267b-985e-a938-cc1a" childId="3798-ca06-de81-9f3d" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></modifier><modifier type="set" field="f2ee-ef5c-ac2f-0a29" value="5+"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="267b-985e-a938-cc1a" childId="9848-a0b1-dc89-f6cd" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers><characteristics><characteristic name="Type" typeId="edb9-a03d-e44e-2632">Infantry</characteristic><characteristic name="Models" typeId="c162-476c-a031-003b">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Damage Value" typeId="f2ee-ef5c-ac2f-0a29">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Transport" typeId="5d1c-b220-d676-62fa">–</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="4eb6-d47b-5598-2dd3" name="Assault Rifle" hidden="false" typeId="687b-50c6-e68d-9ed8" typeName="Weapon"><modifiers><modifier type="increment" field="1c44-f79c-f5d5-65a2" value="1"><repeats><repeat value="1" repeats="1" field="selections" scope="267b-985e-a938-cc1a" childId="3b9e-2d90-d571-ea60" shared="true" roundUp="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></repeats></modifier><modifier type="increment" field="1c44-f79c-f5d5-65a2" value="1"><repeats><repeat value="1" repeats="1" field="selections" scope="267b-985e-a938-cc1a" childId="fc26-98b8-1671-f181" shared="true" roundUp="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></repeats></modifier><modifier type="increment" field="1c44-f79c-f5d5-65a2" va